  "description": "<div>\r\n<p><strong>About thinksound</strong><br>thinksound began in 2009 with one mission: to help people to hear music the way it's meant to be heard. Since then, we&rsquo;ve been dedicated to creating audio products that truly respect the art and craft of music professionals and the planet we live on. Everything we make has to sound amazing, look good, feel comfortable, be priced fairly and produced responsibly. thinksound has received critical acclaim from top industry publications including Head-Fi, Sound + Image, What Hi-Fi, Macworld and more.</p>\r\n<p><strong>ov21</strong><br>The ov21 is our flagship, high-fidelity, studio monitor and our first ever over-ear design. When we set out to build the ov21's, our goal was to not only meet, but exceed the demands of audio professionals, musicians and music enthusiasts. We can confidently say the ov21&rsquo;s are the best we&rsquo;ve ever made.</p>\r\n<p><strong>in20</strong><br>The in20 is the latest in-ear headphone in our award-winning thinksound line. It combines the best of everything in a small package with big sound. It&rsquo;s our most versatile headphone yet and is engineered to have a smooth sound signature via upgraded acoustics so you can listen for hours on end.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>",
